%% Backup and restore flow (vertical layout for better fit in browser)
flowchart TB
    subgraph Create["Create Backup"]
        direction TB
        User1([User]) --> Menu1[Edit > Create Backup]
        Menu1 --> SelectDir[Select destination]
        SelectDir --> Encrypt{Encryption?}
        Encrypt -->|Password| ZIP[.zip file]
        Encrypt -->|GPG| GPG[.gpg file]
    end

    ZIP --> Menu2
    GPG --> Menu2

    subgraph Restore["Import Backup"]
        direction TB
        User2([User]) --> Menu2[Edit > Import Backup]
        Menu2 --> SelectFile[Select .zip or .gpg]
        SelectFile --> Decrypt{Decrypt}
        Decrypt --> RestoreData[Restore connections, credentials, settings]
        RestoreData --> Done[Settings restored]
    end
